<title>POLAND: PAGED APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>PAGED APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.41 vs   1.01</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.68 vs   1.68</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.61 vs   1.52</p>
